<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Evergreen Technologies</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Evergreen Technologies</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Automated outreach, tailored for your business — powered by Evergreen AI.</p>
      <p class="subtext">We build intelligent sales agents that connect, follow up, and close — so you don’t have to.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="https://calendly.com/liam-dutka/llc" class="btn primary">Book a Call</a>
        <a href="mailto:liam.dutka.work@gmail.com" class="btn secondary">Send an Email</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>How Evergreen Works</h2>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <h3>1. Capture Leads</h3>
          <p>Connect your ad campaigns or website forms to Evergreen's AI-powered engine.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>2. Instant Outreach</h3>
          <p>Evergreen texts new leads instantly with professional, personalized follow-up messages.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <h3>3. Book More Jobs</h3>
          <p>Convert more leads while you sleep. Evergreen works 24/7 so you don’t have to.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="why-evergreen">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Why Businesses Choose Evergreen</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>✔️ AI-generated messaging that sounds like you</li>
        <li>✔️ Hands-off follow-up — no manual texting ever again</li>
        <li>✔️ Fully customizable, branded to your business</li>
        <li>✔️ Fast setup, zero tech skills required</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <p>Ready to automate your sales outreach?</p>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/liam-dutka/llc" class="btn primary">Schedule a Demo</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
/* Base */
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  background: #0e1117;
  color: #f3f4f6;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.container {
  max-width: 960px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 2rem;
  text-align: center;
}

/* Header */
header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f2937, #111827);
  padding: 5rem 2rem 3rem;
}

h1 {
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.tagline {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  color: #60f6b5;
}

.subtext {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: #cbd5e1;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.cta-buttons .btn {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
  font-weight: bold;
  border-radius: 6px;
  text-decoration: none;
  transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
}

.primary {
  background-color: #10b981;
  color: #fff;
}

.primary:hover {
  background-color: #059669;
}

.secondary {
  border: 2px solid #10b981;
  color: #10b981;
}

.secondary:hover {
  background-color: #10b981;
  color: #fff;
}

/* How It Works */
.how-it-works {
  background-color: #111827;
  padding: 3rem 2rem;
}

.steps {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

.step h3 {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  color: #60f6b5;
}

.step p {
  color: #d1d5db;
}

/* Why Evergreen */
.why-evergreen {
  background-color: #0e1117;
  padding: 3rem 2rem;
}

.why-evergreen ul {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}

.why-evergreen li {
  margin: 0.75rem 0;
  color: #d1d5db;
}

/* Footer */
footer {
  background: #1f2937;
  padding: 2rem 1rem;
}

footer p {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

footer .btn {
  padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
  font-weight: bold;
}
